    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44892,45136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45272,45636</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>剣士に魔法使いに……
なんでもなれるんだな、オレら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Swordsman, mage... We really
can become *anything*, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>44896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そりゃ『なりきり士』だし
服があれば、なんにでもなれるけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, we *are* "Roleplayers." As
long as we have the right clothes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45028</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>別に服なんてなくてもなれるんだよ。
バジルさん言ってた、オレら真っ白なんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even without the clothes, though. We can still become
anything. Like Basil said, we're "pure white" and all that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45140</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だったら『なりきり士』の力に
頼らない方がいいんじゃない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then maybe we shouldn't rely on
our "Roleplayer" powers anymore?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そっだらことは、ダメだ、&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;！
なーんかあって、ケガでもしたら大事だど！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya can't do that, &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;! If ya get yerself 
into a mess and get hurt, oh, it'd be awful!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>大体、服ないとダメって、
便利なようで、めんどくさいぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'know, if we gotta have clothes to do anything...
It might sound handy, but it's a real pain.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45496</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>着替えなきゃだし、
このヘンテコタンス野郎もいつも一緒だしさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like, we gotta change all the time, and this
weirdo closet's always following us around.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45640</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇの、そのマヌケヅラは、魔物に殴られた方が
ちっとはマシになるかもしんねーな。へへへ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I reckon that stupid face of yers might look a little
better if a monster'd give it a good punch. Hehehe...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_032_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>てめぇは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You friggin'...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
